  "title": "Resource Submission for FORRT",
  "description": "Dear Colleagues,<br><br>FORRT is collecting online resources on open and reproducible science topics to be catalogued and enriched to increase its findability, accessibility, interoperability, and reusability (FAIR). As a part of FORRT's mission, we aim to provide pedagogical materials for educators who are interested in teaching the next generation of researchers and consumers of science open and reproducible practices and embed its principles on their teaching.<br><br>Note that by submitting a resource, there is no transfer of copyright or licence. FORRT merely lists externally hosted resources and tries to keep it updated, tagged with educational metadata, and increase these resources' FAIR use.<br><br>For more information about FORRT, see: <a href=\"https://forrt.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://forrt.org</a>",
  "confirmation": "Your response has been recorded.",
  "collect_email": false,
