    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "entry": "1189322724",
      "title": "Provider/Creators",
      "help": "Separate creators with commas, writing each name as it would appear in a by-line (first name(s), then family name), e.g. Jane Q. Smith, Wei Zhang, Center for Open Science. Please don't use \"and\" or \"&amp;\", citation style (Smith, J.), or titles and degrees (Dr, PhD). If an organisation's name contains a comma, leave the comma out.",
